    "text": "wymt.com\nwebsite\nWhitesburg\nDon Franklin Athlete of the Week: Gunner Holbrook\nBy Makenzie Freeman,\n5 hours agoWHITESBURG, Ky. (WYMT) - Following a week one loss to Johnson Central, Letcher Central has bounced back in their following games against Leslie County and Shelby Valley. Our Don Franklin Athlete of the week, Quarterback Gunner Holbrook, is a big reason for the team getting back on the right track.\n1",
